{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17284","headline":"送黔中裴中丞阁老赴任 · 权德舆","name":"送黔中裴中丞阁老赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五谏留中禁，双旌辍上才。\n内臣持凤诏，天厩锡龙媒。\n宴语暌兰室，辉荣亚柏台。\n怀黄宜命服，举白叹离杯。\n景霁山川迥，风清雾露开。\n辰溪分浩淼，僰道接萦回。\n胜理环中得，殊琛徼外来。\n行看旬岁诏，传庆在公台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}